      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GENTLE SPARK (3) missed the frame last time out when fifth at this track from Box seven (21.44) but draws same box here as latest win. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Can discover winning form. FORTY'S GIRL (4) was in the placings last time but prior to that posted a speedy 20.69 win over 365m at this track. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. ZIPPING LILO (1) goes very well over this track and trip including four wins. Placed last time (25.19) at Goulburn in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 1.5 lengths. Looks suited here and can measure up. PHOENIX'S CHAOS (2) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
